WEBVTT

00:33:25.848 --> 00:33:30.196
Chris is now the wellness manager
at South Metro Fire Rescue in Denver,

00:33:30.220 --> 00:33:31.986
which is a huge organization.

00:33:32.010 --> 00:33:36.735
They have 29 stations,
with more than 800 first responders.

00:33:37.092 --> 00:33:40.836
It's part of Chris's job
to get emotional support to firefighters,

00:33:40.860 --> 00:33:43.206
which means changing the culture.

00:33:43.230 --> 00:33:48.696
CM: Culture of the organization, I think,
plays a huge role in burnout.

00:33:48.720 --> 00:33:52.386
AG: In a recent study, firefighting units
with cultures of care and support

00:33:52.410 --> 00:33:55.341
had fewer health problems
and fewer accidents.

00:33:56.020 --> 00:33:59.336
But in too many fire departments,
that care is missing,

00:33:59.360 --> 00:34:02.226
because people are afraid to seek support.